urn-in-players-era-8-tournament-in-las-vegas</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/18/mens-basketball-mountaineers-down-auburn-in-players-era-8-tournament-in-las-vegas</guid><category>Men's Basketball</category><description><![CDATA[<img alt="West Virginia forward Brenen Lorient celebrates a 3-point basket during Wednesday's game against Auburn at Michelob ULTRA Arena in Las Vegas, Nevada." src="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&image_path=/images/2026/11/18/Lorient-Main.jpg" /><br /><br />West Virginia used a season-high 19 points from Brenen Lorient and some clutch second half free throw shooting to defeat Auburn 76-70 on the opening night of play in the Players Era 8 Tournament at Michelob ULTRA Arena in Las Vegas, Nevada.]]></description><media:thumbnail url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_system&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/18/Lorient-Main.jpg" /><media:content url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/18/Lorient-Main.jpg"><media:title>West Virginia forward Brenen Lorient celebrates a 3-point basket during Wednesday's game against Auburn at Michelob ULTRA Arena in Las Vegas, Nevada.</media:title></media:content><enclosure url="https://wvusports.com/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_prefix=rp_primary&amp;image_path=/images/2026/11/18/Lorient-Main.jpg" length="1" type="image/jpg" /><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 03:19:00 EST</pubDate><s:sport_id>4</s:sport_id><s:story_id>59722</s:story_id></item><item><title>Salcedo Sets Program Record, Mountaineers Break 800 Free Relay Record</title><link>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/17/mens-swimming-diving-salcedo-sets-program-record-mountaineers-break-800-free-relay-record</link><guid>https://wvusports.com/news/2026/11/17/mens-swimming-diving-salcedo-sets-program-record-mountaineers-break-800-free-relay-record</guid><category>Men's Swimming &amp; 